IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lta-landtax`

-- Land Tax Assessment Act 2002 (WA), with the Land Tax Act 2002 s 5 Table 11 -- worked cases, from the seat of the home
-- owner.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, a RevenueWA ruling or calculator, or the regulations that prescribe the capped-value
-- percentage (not deposited).
